sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: Two known valid idTokens with same GroupId are configured
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: EVConnectedPreSession

    alt Transaction was already started
        CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = Authorized, idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken_type>, eventType = Updated)
    else Transaction not yet started
        CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = Authorized, idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken_type>, eventType = Started)
    end
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation (listed under Step 1): TransactionEventResponse<br>idTokenInfo.status Accepted<br>idTokenInfo.groupIdToken.idToken <Configured groupIdToken>

    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted

    CS->>CSMS: AuthorizeRequest (idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken2_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken2_type>)
    CSMS-->>CS: AuthorizeResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation (Step 5): AuthorizeResponse<br>idTokenInfo.status Accepted<br>idTokenInfo.groupIdToken.idToken <Configured groupIdToken>

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = StopAuthorized, idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken2_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken2_type>, eventType = Updated)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation (Step 7): TransactionEventResponse<br>idTokenInfo.status Accepted<br>idTokenInfo.groupIdToken.idToken <Configured groupIdToken>

    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EVConnectedPostSession
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EVDisconnected

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
